<<
/Title (c360 data profiling : This project builds a daily attribute-level profiling framework for C360 events to detect missing or broken data early by measuring total count, null count, distinct count, and completeness percentage for each attribute, event, version, and day. It discovers attributes from DAM and Snowflake, computes the metrics in Snowflake/Snowpark, publishes them to Graphite, and shows them in Grafana, with ongoing work on developing future scops. [booking.com intern])
